        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>What is local SEO and why does it matter in Guildford?</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Local SEO helps service-area and location-based businesses appear when people search in or around Guildford. It covers Google Business Profile optimisation, consistent citations, map pack visibility, and location-specific service content.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Can you help with AI search optimisation?</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Indeed. AI-powered search engines such as Google AI Overviews, ChatGPT, and Perplexity are changing how people find businesses in fundamental ways. I optimise your content to be cited by these systems, ensuring your Guildford business appears in AI-generated answers alongside traditional search results. Read more on my <a href="/ai-search-optimisation-guildford/">AI search optimisation page</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>What industries do you specialise in?</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>I work extensively with Guildford's strongest sectors: gaming and technology companies near Surrey Research Park, professional services firms along the High Street, healthcare providers including those near Royal Surrey County Hospital, property agents, and finance businesses serving the affluent Surrey market. See my <a href="/industries/">industries page</a> for further detail.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Do you offer free SEO audits?</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>I do. My free SEO audit covers technical health, keyword opportunities, and competitor analysis specific to your position in the Guildford market. It shows the condition of your site before you invest in fixes. <a href="/free-seo-audit-guildford/">Request your audit</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>What makes SEO Guildford different from other agencies?</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>SEO Guildford is a specialist consultancy, not a generalist agency. Every strategy is built around Guildford's local market dynamics, from Surrey Research Park's technology corridor to the professional services cluster around Castle Street. I combine technical SEO, semantic content and AI search readiness in a single service. You deal directly with me, the person doing the work, not layers of account management.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>What does a typical SEO campaign for a Guildford business include?</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>A typical SEO campaign for a Guildford business covers technical fixes, keyword research, on-page and service-page optimisation, content improvements, internal linking, Google Business Profile management, and citation and outreach work to build authority. The exact mix depends on whether a business needs local visibility, national reach, or both.</p>
